# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0225.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Request -> P0 Triage
P0 Triage -> Direct edit + existing rails: trivial
P0 Triage -> P3 Rail: bounded bug
P0 Triage -> P1 Interrogate: substantial
P1 Interrogate -> "GATE: spec-lint clean +"
"GATE: spec-lint clean +" -> P2 Decompose
P2 Decompose -> "GATE: coldstart per ticket +"
"GATE: spec-lint clean +" -> P1 Interrogate: divergence high
"GATE: coldstart per ticket +" -> P2 Decompose: gaps
"GATE: coldstart per ticket +" -> P3 Rail
P3 Rail -> "GATE: suite RED for the right reasons +"
"GATE: suite RED for the right reasons +" -> "preflight: environment determinism"
"preflight: environment determinism" -> P4 Build
P4 Build -> "GATE: rails green + build + lint +"
"GATE: rails green + build + lint +" -> P4 Build: "flail or fail: regenerate"
"GATE: rails green + build + lint +" -> P5 Prosecute
P5 Prosecute -> "verify each finding:"
"verify each finding:" -> fix tickets: verified findings
fix tickets -> P4 Build
"verify each finding:" -> "GATE: 2 consecutive dry passes +": dry
"GATE: 2 consecutive dry passes +" -> P6 Integrate
P6 Integrate -> P7 Distill
P7 Distill -> P1 Interrogate: lessons → lints and skills priors → model-router questions → P1 templates
Direct edit + existing rails -> P5 Prosecute

SPECIFY — human + best-available judgment { P1 Interrogate, "GATE: spec-lint clean +", P2 Decompose, "GATE: coldstart per ticket +" }
RAIL + BUILD — mid/cheap models inside structure { P3 Rail, "GATE: suite RED for the right reasons +", "preflight: environment determinism", P4 Build, "GATE: rails green + build + lint +" }
PROSECUTE — pooled fresh contexts { P5 Prosecute, "verify each finding:", "GATE: 2 consecutive dry passes +", fix tickets }
